-- World data pack 071-toa-encounter-spawns
-- The six encounter creatures no source spawns (Battler, Snatcher, Linos, Sobekhotep, Malamis, a wavelord), one in each realm copy of Atlantis.
-- Built by tools/toa/build_data_packs.py from tools/toa/sql. Do not hand-edit:
-- the server applies a pack once per save, so a fix ships as a new pack.
-- Applied by the server in one transaction (docs/TOA_DATA_PACKS.md).

-- ======== part: 071-toa-encounter-spawns.sql ========

-- 071-toa-encounter-spawns: the six encounter creatures no source spawns (WP3.3). Hand-written, SQLite.
--
-- DOLSharp's artifact quests name 27 creatures; 21 stand in the gaheris spawns of pack 020. These six
-- do not: Battler, Snatcher, Linos, Sobekhotep, Malamis and a wavelord. Each gets one spawn in every
-- realm copy of Atlantis (Albion 73, Midgard 30, Hibernia 130; the copies are geometric clones, both
-- anchor creatures of every spot below stand on the same X, Y and Z in all three).
--
-- Placement: no source gives coordinates. Each stands in the zone the Herald and the Herald's scholar
-- table give its artifact, at the midpoint of two creatures of one camp (floor and depth are theirs).
-- Look and gear come from a similar creature of that zone; the stats are the level 65 values the
-- gaheris rows use without a template (Strength 7, Dexterity 2, Constitution and Quickness 1 per
-- level). NPCTemplateID -1: the named gaheris templates replace the mob values, name included.
-- Aggression as the gaheris named creatures (60 %, 800 units); respawn 30 minutes, like Eramai.
--
-- Idempotent: fixed Mob_IDs, INSERT OR IGNORE. Undo: DELETE FROM Mob WHERE PackageID = 'toa-encounters'.

